<title>FRANCE: FIGURE SKATING-CANDELORO TO MISS WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</title>
<headline>FIGURE SKATING-CANDELORO TO MISS WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frenchman Philippe Candeloro has withdrawn from next week's figure skating world championships in Lausanne, Switzerland.</p>
<p>Candeloro, European championship silver medallist in January, said on Tuesday he lacked confidence and still felt pain on landing some jumps following ankle surgery in May last year.</p>
